  "text_units": [
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-c7378c54420b",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "A long time ago when I was in third grade I had a friend @PERSON2 who's mom was in a bad mood.",
      "start_offset": 0,
      "end_offset": 94,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 0,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-2c59a5ea8abe",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "She never laughed and she never smiled.",
      "start_offset": 95,
      "end_offset": 134,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 1,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-90228299cd1b",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "Every time I saw her I would smile at her and all she would do was frown and keep walking.",
      "start_offset": 135,
      "end_offset": 225,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 2,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-1869e57812fa",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "At first I didn't know she was a grouch i just thought she didn't like me or something.",
      "start_offset": 226,
      "end_offset": 313,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 3,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-77a492420fde",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "When @PERSON2 told me his mom was a grouch I started to laugh and laugh.",
      "start_offset": 313,
      "end_offset": 385,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 4,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-8c8ab704704b",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "He asked me what was so funny i told him that i thought his mom didn't like me or something because every time I see his mom I would smile at her and all she will do is frown and walk away.",
      "start_offset": 386,
      "end_offset": 575,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 5,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-0f8377773aeb",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "That made my friend laugh we were cracking up so hard that we got in trouble in class.",
      "start_offset": 576,
      "end_offset": 662,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 6,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-4ea49fe92346",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "The next day @PERSON2 and I were eating lunch at school when he says to me &lt;hey your pretty good at making people laugh&gt;.",
      "start_offset": 665,
      "end_offset": 792,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 7,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-d8c3140f5130",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "I said &lt;no I am not my jokesare horrible&gt;.",
      "start_offset": 793,
      "end_offset": 841,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 8,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-86f4acd128dc",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "He said &lt;@CAPS1 lets put them to the test go up to some one new to this school&gt;.",
      "start_offset": 842,
      "end_offset": 928,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 9,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-1176c991aaa5",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "I said @CAPS1 so we went around the whole school looking for a new student unfortunately we couldn't find one we heard the bell ring and we ran to our class.",
      "start_offset": 929,
      "end_offset": 1086,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 10,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-b7b76fb7289a",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "We sat in the back of the classroom its only @PERSON2 and I and anempty seat between us.",
