      "end_offset": 1873,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 21,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-6192b70e66dd",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "At first she didn't laugh because she didn't get it but duringthe middle of the movie she said &lt;ohhhh I get itand she started to laugh.",
