      "end_offset": 2424,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 27,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-511965a4d1bd",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "When I got to @PERSON2 house the first thing we did was play video games.",
      "start_offset": 2425,
      "end_offset": 2498,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 28,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-b2cb47768c40",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "When it was dinner time we all sat down at the table to eat @PERSON2 and I were on one side and his parents on the other.",
      "start_offset": 2499,
      "end_offset": 2620,
      "unit_type": "sentence",
      "sequence_index": 29,
      "chunk_title": null,
      "chunk_method": "rule"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "unit-da7ff9bb6ce0",
      "document_id": "doc-f34ce0393252",
      "text": "When we started eating @PERSON2 told me to tell the joke to his parents i said @CAPS1.",
